<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it intended to issue 320 million call warrants on shares of China Light and Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$31.86</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.701</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	06.JAN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
